    "title": "RCHS Soccer teams defeat Clinton County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Zac Oakes ,\n1 days ago The Russell County Laker and Lady Laker Soccer teams defeated Clinton County last night. The Lady Lakers defeated the Lady Bulldogs by a score of 9-1. Addison Coffey led the Lady Lakers with 3 goals on the night, followed by Madison Weisbrodt and Adriana Thomas with 2 goals each. Bella Blakey and Marissa Hatchett each scored a goal in the win. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
